@@ ============================================================
@@ ETMB4 — Earth-To-Mars-&-Back mission (2048): Venus-flyby return (worked example)
@@ Fixed dates for the validated opposition-class return (Mars->Venus->Earth). Calls
@@ OppRoute and returns the return-leg itinerary as tagged values. The fiche figure shows
@@ the full to-scale trajectory (outbound + Venus-assisted return).
@@ Author & design         : Jean Wilson
@@ Co-authors & programming : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
@@ Input  : (none)
@@   ( -- MarsDeparture VenusFlyby EarthArrival ReturnDays dVTEI turnReq EarthEntry )  tagged
@@ ============================================================
 2469315 2469470 2469535 → t3 tv t4 «
   t3 tv t4 ⓁOppRoute → R «
     t3 "MarsDeparture" →Tag
     tv "VenusFlyby" →Tag
     t4 "EarthArrival" →Tag
     R 5 GET "ReturnDays" →Tag
     R 1 GET "dVTEI_kms" →Tag
     R 3 GET "turnReq_deg" →Tag
     R 6 GET "EarthEntry_kms" →Tag
   »
